& [FieldTypes]
  + new request and receipt UUIDs are nonnil lowercase hyphenated strings; commits are forty lowercase hexadecimal characters; ContentDigest is existing algorithm sha256 with sixty-four lowercase hex value
  + timestamps raw byte counts and evidence totals are u64; maximum_attempts retry cleanup artifact_count deterministic_replay_count required_fresh_process_replay_count are u8; numeric effect counters and effect_count are u32
  + positive authority fixture byte_identical and physical_contact fields are bool; input_class is existing KcvInputClass; decision kinds use B1CDriveOperatorDecisionKind; supplied_a3_status_assertion uses KrvStatusAssertion
  + comparison_outcome is before_decision_interval within_decision_interval or after_decision_interval; authority_packet_request is B1OaprRequest; artifacts are twenty ordered path bytes sha256 entries; references are unique nonempty bounded opaque strings
  + all other scalar text remains String; imported legacy forms and their narrower bounds are unchanged

& [CanonicalAndDigests]
  + compact typed declaration order and exact reserialization reject duplicates field reordering whitespace alternate escaping and trailing data
  + own semantic digest alone is normalized to SHA256 empty bytes; request receipt and manifest each use their ODCV-024 domain and one NUL byte
  + legacy signature uses unchanged legacy domain and complete canonical payload including checked payload digest; no new signing context
  + transport files have exactly one LF; manifest raw hashes include it and candidate raw hashes exclude it

& [ComparisonAndCoverage]
  + direct u64 comparisons enforce issued < expires; issued <= observed < expires is within; expiry equality is after
  + A4 observation is supplied data not current time; A3 status remains descriptive
  + legacy request and policy digests bind policy-carried A1/A3 raw hashes; A4 association remains unsigned and all execution fields remain false

& [Evidence]
  + explicit-input verifier consumes the first nineteen named files; directory verifier consumes twenty-one; reconstruct legacy verification inside the pure adapter
  + manifest retains full-chain receipt digests including A4 and legacy verification, current packet digest and complete reconstructed A5 receipt
  + production files are bounded direct regular nonlink inputs; fresh-process obligation is checked by external gates, not represented as processes started by the pure verifier
